#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:361
msgid ""
"The Default Country Code is used to format numbers that don't include an "
"international prefix (e.g., +358).\n"
"\n"
"If left empty, the system tries to detect it automatically from your SIM "
"card or network.\n"
"\n"
"You can manually override it here by entering a 2-letter ISO region code (e."
"g. US, FI, DE) or a calling code (e.g. +358, 358, +1, 1)."
msgstr ""
"Código de País Predeterminado ukax jakhunakar formato ukar uñt’ayañatakiw "
"apnaqasi, ukax janiw mä prefijo internacional ukankiti (e.g., +358).\n"
"\n"
"Ch’usa jaytatächi ukhaxa, sistema ukax tarjeta SIM jan ukax red ukat "
"automáticamente uñt’ayañ yant’i.\n"
"\n"
"Aka chiqanx amparampiw uñakipt’asispa, 2 letra ISO suyun chimpu (e.g. US, "
"FI, DE) jan ukax jawsañ chimpu (e.g. +358, 358, +1, 1) ukar mantasa."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:382
msgid ""
"The ringback tone is the sound played (toot-toot-toot) while waiting for an "
"outgoing call to be answered. Some carriers don't generate it so we have "
"option to generate it manually here. \n"
"\n"
"You can select your own music file, or clear it to use the standard system "
"tone."
msgstr ""
"Tono de ringback ukax mä mistur jawsañ jaysañ suyt’kasax (toot-toot-toot) "
"phust’atäki ukawa. Yaqhip carriers ukanakax janiw generapkiti ukhamatw "
"opción ukax utjistu manualmente generar akan. \n"
"\n"
"Jumax pachpa musica archivo ajlliñamawa, jan ukax q’umachañamawa sistema "
"estándar tono apnaqañataki."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:402
msgid "Select Ringback Tone"
msgstr "Tono de retorno ukar ajlliñamawa"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:410
msgid "Audio Files"
msgstr "Audio Archivonaka"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:436
msgid ""
"Select the address books to use with Telephony and arrange them in order of "
"priority. The topmost address book has the highest priority and will be "
"preferred if a number is found in multiple address books. You can use the "
"Duplicate Resolver toggle below to help manage duplicates, but even if "
"disabled, we encourage enabling it for a better experience."
msgstr ""
"Telefonía ukamp apnaqañatak direccionanak ajlliñamawa ukat nayrar "
"sartañapatakix ordenampiw wakichtʼañama. Jilïr direccionanakan libropajj "
"jukʼamp nayrankiwa, ukat walja direccionanakan mä jakhüwijj jikjjatasispa "
"ukhajja, jukʼamp askiwa. Aka amparamp lurat Duplicate Resolver toggle ukax "
"duplicados ukanakar apnaqañ yanapt’añatakiw apnaqasispa, ukampis jan "
"ch’amanchatäkchisa, juk’amp suma experiencia ukar ch’amanchañatakiw "
"ch’amanchapxta."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:455
msgid ""
"When enabled, if the same phone number calls you 3 times within 5 minutes, "
"the third call (and subsequent ones within the window) will force the phone "
"to ring at maximum volume, bypassing Silent or Do Not Disturb modes."
msgstr ""
"Kunawsatix ch’amanchatäki ukhax pachpa teléfono jakhüwix 3 kuti 5 minutos "
"ukjat jawsani ukhax kimsïr jawsatax (ukat qhipa jawsatanakax ventana ukan) "
"telefonoruw mä jach’a volumen ukar jawsañapatak wayt’ani, Silencio jan ukax "
"No Disturb modos ukanakar jan yäqasa."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:467
msgid ""
"Choose contacts that will always play notifications at full volume, even "
"when the phone is in Silent or Do Not Disturb mode."
msgstr ""
"Contactos ukanakax sapa kutiw yatiyawinak taqpach volúmenes ukan phust’ani, "
"kunapachatix teléfono Silencio jan ukax No Disturb ukankchi ukhas."

